// REQUIRES: host-linux-amd64 || host-linux-arm64
// RUN: %python %S/Inputs/run-panics.py %S/Inputs/panics-allocword
// P04.25 review R1: the test intrinsic gopp_test_make_slice (built with
// -test-intrinsics, which runlib adds for a program that uses gopp_test_) has
// the checks of `make` (Go's makeslice): a capacity whose byte size overflows,
// a length over the capacity and a negative length or capacity panic with
// Go's first line and exit status 2 before any allocator is called. Written
// by hand: the intrinsic is not Go.
